      {
        "name": "places/ChIJK08O_6QBBDQR_h3NKo6rwSE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Sb1ZHUnJOMHRDUTBGUVFuRktObFJVT1dFMWQxRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ 尖沙咀的寶藏咖啡館\n\n如果您想在尖沙咀找個地方放鬆身心，悠閒地享用一杯香醇的咖啡，避開熙熙攘攘的人群，那就來這裡吧！這間位於尖沙咀中心的咖啡廳空間寬敞、乾淨整潔，佈置精美。我特別喜歡這裡的大桌子——如果您需要伸展一下，這裡簡直完美。氣氛溫馨舒適，而且出乎意料的是，一點也不吵鬧。這裡簡直是放慢腳步、享受一杯優質咖啡的絕佳寧靜綠洲。強烈推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ An absolute gem in TST\nIf you’re looking for a spot in Tsim Sha Tsui to actually relax and enjoy a proper cup of coffee without the usual chaotic crowds, this is it. The TST Centre location is incredibly spacious, clean, and beautifully laid out. I loved the large tables—perfect if you need to spread out a bit. The vibe is warm and cozy, and surprisingly, it wasn't too noisy at all. A fantastic, peaceful oasis to slow down and enjoy a premium brew. Highly recommended!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
